ee-year-old’s body?!\"\n\nThe order is on the verge of collapse. I rescued the pitiful protagonist of the game... only to somehow end up taking his place.\n\nNow I’m the Pope. But this place is crawling with fanatics secretly worshiping an evil god, and spies from the royal court.\n\nEven the holy knights who are left... have completely lost it.\n\n\"Daddy! Call me Daddy, Master!\"\n\"I told you, I’m the Pope, not Master!\"\n\"You're so cute! You need to eat a hundred meals a day!\"\n\"Shut it.\"\n\nAs both a healer and the Pope, I need someone to play the role of my \"Daddy\" and protect me.\n\nThe problem? Every single one of my Daddy candidates is completely unhinged. And even the male lead I let go so he could live a happy life...\n\n\"As long as I have you, I don’t care if the world burns.\"\n\n...seems to have come back not quite right in the head.\n\nCan our crumbling order really survive and bring peace to the world? Watch the Baby Pope sweat it out to save the world!","year":2025,"status":"completed","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Romance","Comedy","Fantasy"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/d77e233d-f696-406f-a030-e3754236dd0b/762bc609-c660-4c52-b3cd-524910c26261.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ko","availableLanguages":["pl","en"],"lane":"manhwa","rating":8.48,"follows":477,"listAt":"2026-10-27T12:21:11.748Z","chapters":[{"id":"b7a82359-3e59-4466-91d3-8197e82ebdca","number":null,"volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":14,"createdAt":"2025-07-24T20:36:22+00:00","baked":false}],"chapterCount":1,"chaptersAt":"2026-10-26T19:10:15.841Z"},"1f072717-6bde-493d-862f-6fc9574c3593":{"id":"1f072717-6bde-493d-862f-6fc9574c3593","title":"Neoneun Idaelo Dah-eun Jeogdo Eobs-i","altTitle":"You’ve Never Reached Me Like This","description":"For 500 years, Mujin has been offering prayers to guide lost spirits to their rest. Then, in front of him, appears Geumji—his lover who died 300 years ago—reborn. But even in this life, she is already a dead soul. Unaware that she has died, she has returned to Mujin.","year":2025,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Historical","Romance","Drama","Fantasy"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/1f072717-6bde-493d-862f-6fc9574c3593/5026a866-7142-478c-967d-e9aef88f613b.png.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ko","availableLanguages":["en"],"lane":"manhwa","rating":10,"follows":45,"listAt":"2026-10-27T12:21:11.748Z","chapters":[{"id":"7aa47d06-1dec-462a-939c-aa858c9ade07","number":"2","volume":"1","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":19,"createdAt":"2026-05-01T13:50:59+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"bcd84800-6730-4089-aabe-fec17bac8ae9","number":"1","volume":"1","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":24,"createdAt":"2026-03-28T02:55:09+00:00","baked":false}],"chapterCount":2,"chaptersAt":"2026-10-26T19:11:08.461Z"},"0c333b5c-d052-4fee-b18b-c907a2a256b7":{"id":"0c333b5c-d052-4fee-b18b-c907a2a256b7","title":"Perfect Glitter","altTitle":"パーフェクト グリッター","description":"Momo spends her days posting pictures on social media and survives on the few \"likes\" she gets. One day, she suddenly receives an invitation to meet up with her idol, Ichika, an influencer. Momo is overjoyed by the unexpected good news, but what awaits her ahead? Is it heaven or a one-way ticket to hell?","year":2024,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Psychological","Drama"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/0c333b5c-d052-4fee-b18b-c907a2a256b7/38efde62-527f-438f-9a51-6102b7ff4474.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["vi","en"],"lane":"manga","rating":8.04,"follows":1261,"listAt":"2026-10-26T18:45:14.581Z","chapters":[{"id":"8078bf57-5f24-4ac5-a5e5-aabca3b234da","number":"9","volume":"1","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":14,"createdAt":"2026-10-21T04:48:03+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"5143bdbe-53fa-40b0-9891-8e913348ee0b","number":"8","volume":"1","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":13,"createdAt":"2026-09-24T04:15:0